# Sentinel SOC Lab

**Detecting, Triaging, and Hunting Attacks with Microsoft Sentinel and Defender XDR**

Sentinel SOC Lab is a hands-on SOC lab I built on Azure while preparing for the Microsoft SC-200 (Security Operations Analyst) exam. I deployed a Windows Server 2022 VM, streamed its security logs into Microsoft Sentinel, wrote custom detections mapped to MITRE ATT&CK, simulated attacks against the VM, and investigated the resulting incidents in the Microsoft Defender portal using KQL.

**Tools:** Microsoft Sentinel, Microsoft Defender XDR, Microsoft Defender for Endpoint, Defender for Cloud, Azure Monitor Agent, Log Analytics, KQL, PowerShell
**Built:** September 2026

